codex
A live genuine gap is confirmed in `ChiseledBookShelfBlock`: vanilla invokes comparator-output neighbor notification during block removal (`ChiseledBookShelfBlock.java:165-168`), and Pumpkin already has the live `on_state_replaced` dispatch plus `World::update_comparators`. I’ll wire that existing hook using the old block as the notification source. The remaining leads are modeled, renamed/inlined, or client-only packet API surface; I won’t add dead accessors or factories.
