codex
The three files already contain most leads as Rust hooks or generated state data. One real parity defect is in the live torch removal hook: it notifies neighbors even when a piston moved the torch, while vanilla skips that notification for `movedByPiston`. I’ll correct that existing caller path and add a pure unit test for the gating rule.
